## Identity

Developmental science atlas (preconception → age 3). OKF v0.2; evidence cards are the unit of truth. Fifteen curated chapters live in `chapters/`. Archival drafts live in `preliminary/drafts-chapters/` and must not be overwritten.

## Hard Guardrails

- Never set `status: stable` unless all five rules hold: (1) resolvable sources, (2) no retraction/EoC, (3) independent or conceptual replication on the card, (4) YAML `confidence` matches in-body grades, (5) “What This Does Not Mean” matches the identification.
- Never rewrite sleep, attachment-intervention, or screen-time *theory* without explicit user instruction.
- Never tag `v0.x` without `preliminary/releases/v0.x-slice.md` and a CHANGELOG entry.
- Never invent prescriptions. If evidence does not justify an action, say so.
- Never auto-merge promotions.

## File Boundaries

- Curated copy: `chapters/0N-*.md` (Appendix B 2,500–4,000 words; Ch. 2 may be shorter).
- Archival drafts: `preliminary/drafts-chapters/` — read-only unless explicitly instructed.
- Cards: `evidence-cards/*.md`; template `evidence-cards/_TEMPLATE.md`.
- Extraction notes: `preliminary/research/extraction/*.md`.

## Tone

Direct technical prose. No motivational framing. No generic parenting advice.
